{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 MIDI Velocity EQ (for Gabri)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 A sort of MIDI EQ that selectively applies percentages of a custom velocity curve. Developed through vibe-coding (AI-assisted).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Dedicato a mia mamma Gabriella per il suo 83 compleanno.\par}
